<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  A market you could access was deleted
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Market removed
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  A market that was previously available to your Dukka staff account has been deleted. You will no longer see it in your workspace.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Name" value=marketName}}
  {{> detail-row label="Code" value=marketCode}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Need this market back?"}}
  Only an administrator can recreate or restore market access. Reach out if this deletion affects work you are responsible for.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Your remaining market assignments are unchanged unless you receive another notice.
</p>
